/-!
# Odd centralizers in groups of type Ru

This boundary exports the cubic deductions with exact I.4.1(2) discharged,
the earlier-source Suzuki inputs, and the complete J.2.10 deduction from
J.2.9 with its odd complement constructed by transfer. The connected
J.2.9–10 assembly retains precisely the J.2.7(7),(8),(10) witnesses.

The full eleven-clause J.2.7 still requires its normalizer extension and
involution geometry, and a source repair of the old FiveCore arithmetic
interface. That interface assumes conclusions and an incompatible core
containment; it is preserved for compatibility, not treated as a source
proof. Final assembly remains here and no conclusion is added to Ru.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, printed pp.435–438 (PDF pp.446–449).
-/
